                  <nc xml:id="m-f9468a00-9cbd-4949-9c54-0e664657601a" pname="g" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-551b5835-b733-49ce-a501-c90539c19c9b" facs="#m-f69fd9f1-3f3f-4bf5-84fd-19bf1d84e686" form="virgula" /><custos xml:id="m-4267dcdf-d6bd-4cd1-80fd-496876744ab8" facs="#m-fa25370e-0799-4def-808a-087504b1697c" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-c117b14c-26f0-4c89-8792-c21dc3b6b59f"><lg xml:id="m-70d6ce95-9a50-4dcc-b3f6-0a475b961f52"><l xml:id="m-112cbaf5-9d36-4440-b771-92d600017f73" facs="#m-6a339a40-2307-4a7b-87b3-9fcc75711d70" label="ambiguous">August 22.</l><l xml:id="m-02960639-d2a0-45cb-a1d2-16321a39370e" facs="#m-cea4e22e-de7c-46ef-954d-08e3807341fc" label="ambiguous">1612</l><l xml:id="m-9f3cbe12-28a1-4c5e-8cb4-80af1cb20c78" facs="#m-b4ee1cc7-1f82-498c-a6e8-0c3e52bda3be" label="text-like">AT MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-881e4453-7776-469c-8394-1ca95440ab32" facs="#m-ec153b17-d148-4263-83ed-8c55837c516e" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-0cd5aa57-afb2-4801-a0c1-d171a87fbe62" facs="#m-602095d0-b514-4000-b39a-2e2b15fc8411" label="ambiguous">5.</l><l xml:id="m-8b0b54e3-134f-4bf6-9c58-57be605afffe" facs="#m-e9402058-5d25-4894-abfe-8846c821f17d" label="lyrics-like"> D-e-ámus"cum fi-dú-ci-a ad thró-num grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-a54e0936-0b6b-455a-b27e-58a370417f96" facs="#m-90ad75e0-b6c3-4c35-a509-c0721e33f45a" label="lyrics-like">ti- ae, ut mi-se-ri-córdi-am consequá¬ mur, et grá¬</l><l xml:id="m-09645bc8-9bb0-4bb7-9d22-e9e10491590d" facs="#m-de2ac858-a31f-4508-ad83-4b62743ca010" label="lyrics-like">ti-am inve-ni- a- mus in au-xí- li- 0 op-por¬</l><l xml:id="m-f49e604c-4e11-49c9-8cbc-71e794263a3c" facs="#m-e28e293f-bf6d-43b2-ab95-8263ca56775f" label="lyrics-like">tú-no. Ps. Eructávit cor mé-um vérbum bónum:“ dí-co</l><l xml:id="m-a9bce4f1-21e0-4393-8c30-f2159e6d7532" facs="#m-d44adadc-5adb-48c1-b54c-46e2d6d85ef6" label="lyrics-like">égo ópe-ra mé-a régi. Gló-ri-a Pátri. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-bd56158c-4656-4c16-a867-d992a6efacc1" facs="#m-7fa44bd5-5553-48c4-9ba2-1fe6c2ea1d7b" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-81fbbbe1-3976-4a28-b590-d13a262a3bfc" facs="#m-01c15c1c-1abb-4776-8fdf-7052aeea078d" label="lyrics-like">Mnipotens sempitérne Deus, qui ¡ festivitátem devóta mente recolén¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9de24c8-d075-4fac-807d-c43fbdb78ce9" facs="#m-1d673a19-188b-4146-8150-03cf71e4740f" label="lyrics-like">U in Corde beâtae Mariae Virgi¬</l><l xml:id="m-32a43ab4-f4d8-4c5a-86cb-1a72b49adda2" facs="#m-2359240e-77e5-4624-82d7-e24175387883" label="lyrics-like">tes, *secúndum Cor tuum vivere</l><l xml:id="m-c4ba9ccd-d096-46ba-a226-661a12787dfd" facs="#m-6e43dc01-0a74-4b0a-9cf4-ac6a12a80fbe" label="lyrics-like">valeámus. Per Dóminum... in uni¬</l><l xml:id="m-a75ce17c-9a44-48ee-a0dd-1a5fba244418" facs="#m-181c0fe6-bcd5-486a-92df-f953391a94b3" label="lyrics-like">nis dignum Spiritus Sancti habitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-ecd0da51-5af7-4555-969d-725c0fced4fc" facs="#m-3e91cbb8-a303-4dfb-ad4a-49656f0ad567" label="lyrics-like">táte ejúsdem.</l><l xml:id="m-019ec04f-6832-41b7-916e-206e5df7654e" facs="#m-4e01ea3a-7952-44a6-b45f-3110e79520cd" label="lyrics-like">culum praeparásti:t concéde propi¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d2c6fde-6ab5-4cb6-acdf-5881decf2e69" facs="#m-020672fe-d186-48fe-91bc-d1ae8cdd913f" label="lyrics-like">tius; ut ejúsdem immaculáti Cordis</l><l xml:id="m-37c83deb-1001-4189-ab6a-6ceac7b69209" facs="#m-3ad4e4fa-8bd4-469d-aec9-010a532d42fa" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Sapientiae. Eccli. 24, 23-31.</l><l xml:id="m-b9387c03-018c-4c42-b697-84be8eb8e02c" facs="#m-c437d907-40ef-4533-89fa-3ed4ca24c5d8" label="lyrics-like">vGO quasi vitis fructificávi suavi- meus super mel dulcis, et heréditas</l><l xml:id="m-d6a70b0c-447e-460b-b742-17f905d4f127" facs="#m-cacd338c-aec0-4055-b049-55b1d369c58c" label="lyrics-like">mea super mel et favúm. Memória</l><l xml:id="m-d1277ecb-e76d-406e-acc1-4c6963e9b6b0" facs="#m-59677f52-4fa4-42e6-bd17-e0a07b164f84" label="lyrics-like">U tátem odóris: et flores mei,</l><l xml:id="m-d00bf62f-8334-45d6-b1e9-fc309f5634ce" facs="#m-5475bed7-3732-41c8-8b9c-f6c3728bc1c3" label="lyrics-like">mea in generatiónes saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-91aacdef-fd5d-4732-900b-0f71becdf05c" facs="#m-85461904-0777-4d3c-951c-edf1384edad0" label="lyrics-like">fructus honóris et honestátis. Ego</l><l xml:id="m-550d68e2-2e51-4519-b62e-53d788465614" facs="#m-2b60d3bf-de82-4154-8f5c-80dd2d4e65ac" label="lyrics-like">Qui edunt me, adhuc esúrient: et</l><l xml:id="m-b3a5cc40-69f8-4b13-a556-9d56f57027c4" facs="#m-68a3f132-a39e-4b08-9893-2b04b5df24b4" label="lyrics-like">mater pulchrae dilectiónis, et timó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ad2039bc-6c94-4b75-a86c-6851739fc228" facs="#m-9e865c5f-160d-421a-8f98-a004e355fe52" label="lyrics-like">qui bibunt me, adhuc sítient. Qui</l><l xml:id="m-2bb36235-10cc-496a-8cfc-5b53301e84f6" facs="#m-5b1aafd2-866a-42f7-8093-788a1a120617" label="lyrics-like">ris, et agnitiónis, et sanctae spei.</l><l xml:id="m-1e5c14f3-f350-41f6-8a0a-c3d645b815da" facs="#m-7ef1e833-d5ec-466a-b578-24c5452ae979" label="lyrics-like">audit me, non confundétur: et qui</l><l xml:id="m-b77009f4-474d-499a-ae23-7812fcc7d4d0" facs="#m-7fa5aa4a-187a-4898-b4bf-fe446f5932eb" label="lyrics-like">In me grátia omnis viae et veritá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7f70bae3-7600-4fe1-bdbf-96ccde6c032a" facs="#m-aed29bb2-06c3-456f-840f-018a2563bacf" label="ambiguous">tis: in me omnis spes vitae, et</l><l xml:id="m-973ca415-cfc5-420f-9ce9-2276b7f4524b" facs="#m-56fc3d9e-5942-40e3-9d6e-bd47f360c780" label="lyrics-like">operántur in me, non peccábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-fd905d4a-bdf4-4997-a5bf-16500c359dfe" facs="#m-aa259da6-2030-403e-b10d-c85be82fb6d9" label="lyrics-like">Qui elúcidant me, vitam aetérnam</l><l xml:id="m-1c7856e8-c00b-43e5-a84a-60d82f0ad549" facs="#m-b99da72b-db34-4b17-83e0-234427666c7d" label="lyrics-like">virtútis. Transite ad me omnes qui</l><l xml:id="m-8e50da4d-a1a6-492b-8316-35c6db288974" facs="#m-818a1ea9-e72d-4475-8ed3-f1f007a1e50d" label="lyrics-like">concupíscitis me, et a generatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-3297cbd9-fb6d-4e6f-b6e0-351955b1ee0c" facs="#m-40edf0c8-5f47-4adc-bc97-8543d9dfe210" label="lyrics-like">habébunt.</l><l xml:id="m-9ab5149b-36f0-41b4-813d-0125c08756af" facs="#m-d90730c5-ded7-4cd2-84b7-ad285648f4dc" label="lyrics-like">nibus meis implémini. Splritus enim</l><l xml:id="m-e4a84e66-0704-4b86-a3cb-68684b669560" facs="#m-74cd7540-c2a0-4e3e-8592-c25661428630" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-5f794f2c-2dbd-46c9-9791-022e0596f1d3" facs="#m-34e9fde2-6556-4f83-b4c9-c866a3459030" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-dd115fc5-5088-44a1-b4bf-549083a05bce" facs="#m-89a54bd5-2feb-45c7-b861-7c5994fae5f0" label="lyrics-like">Xsultá-bit" cor</l><l xml:id="m-5c7aeef8-66b5-4c5a-9689-d2fbb75ab23f" facs="#m-5774d3eb-e81c-4e23-89c7-649f90860b5b" label="lyrics-like">mé- um in sa¬ lu-tá¬ri</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
